the agency has not required changes. Custom code aimed at one specific chip cluster can raise how much of that hardware actually works from the low 40s percent range into the low 50s without buying new machines.

00:07:42.055 --> 00:07:52.455
Meta's Lama 3 job on 16,000 H100 chips reached only 38-43% of theoretical math peak, and Google's PALM landed at 46%.

00:07:52.455 --> 00:07:59.735
