00:08:45.175 --> 00:08:50.055
The point was not a faster single chip, it was deleting every interface between the

00:08:50.055 --> 00:08:52.835
neural network and the silicon that would run it at volume.

00:08:53.615 --> 00:08:56.935
XAI's rewrite applies that same idea on the software side.

00:08:57.375 --> 00:09:02.035
